------
  Copyright (c) 2013-2026 Ramon Santamaria (@raysan5)
  https://github.com/raysan5/raylib
  Licensed under the zlib/libpng license.

  raylib is not copied into this repository, and is no longer built here.
  The library comes from org.jank-lang.commons/raylib-sys on Clojars, which
